depression. And I've had since then many people write to me from around the world, frankly, about how finding purpose brought them out of depression. And some people would say, better than any drug, better than any psychotherapy I ever engaged in. engaged in. So your research has found that people with a greater sense of purpose employ different emotion regulation strategies than people who have a weaker sense of purpose.

