and in some ways it makes sense. If you're actually driven by something, it feels like you should have more energy and willpower to stick at it. Studies show that if you put a backpack on a person that's 25 pounds and say, this backpack is just dead weight, or put another backpack on another group of people and say, this backpack has important scientific equipment that you're carrying, it's a very important purposeful backpack.

