equipment that you're carrying. It's a very important purposeful backpack. And you put both of them on a ramp and they estimate how steep the ramp is. The group carrying the purposeful backpack, even though it still just had dead weight, it wasn't carrying scientific equipment, the people carrying that backpack perceive the slope to be far lower.

63
